patterns-tabs.apiDescription:
## Inputs

```
export type TabListComponentInputs = {
  /**
   * The index of the selected tab. Bind it to start on another tab, or to follow the selection.
   *
   * @default 0
   */
  selected?: number; // two-way: [(selected)]
}
```

## Outputs

```
export type TabListComponentOutputs = {
  /** The index of the selected tab. Bind it to start on another tab, or to follow the selection. */
  selectedChange: (e: number) => void;
}
```
